            Design longitudinal clinical trials for spatial transcriptomics platforms. 
            Models power based on hierarchical variability (Patients > Slices > Spots) 
            to detect tissue-level architecture changes.
          </p>
          <div className="mt-6 flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-mono">
            <span className="bg-indigo-500/30 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-indigo-400/30">Citing PoweREST Framework</span>
